  lines:
  - speaker: Lumi
    portrait: {fileID: 1097298525319628428, guid: 25d3a49108ae92346a5bb5a64d9c8721, type: 3}
    text: Clever fish! Here, take this to ride the Fast Current. Think of it as a
      loan.
  - speaker: You
    portrait: {fileID: -4255054504167156931, guid: 24d008a2918cc544f87755498eae8b2b, type: 3}
    text: What about Pip?
  - speaker: Lumi
    portrait: {fileID: 1097298525319628428, guid: 25d3a49108ae92346a5bb5a64d9c8721, type: 3}
    text: He will be fine. Probably. Off you go!
  - speaker: 
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Behind the rock, a small orange fish watches you swim away.
